# Local env — never commit real credentials.
.env
.env*.local

# TanStack Router generated route tree. Committed (not ignored) so a fresh
# checkout / CI can `typecheck` without a generate step — it is deterministic,
# machine-independent, and `@ts-nocheck`. `vite dev` / `vite build` regenerate it
# on route changes; commit the refreshed file alongside the route change.
#
# The Better Auth schema (src/auth/better-auth.schema.sql) is likewise COMMITTED,
# not ignored: ADR-010 makes it the vendored source of truth for `auth:apply`, so
# a clean checkout must have it on disk. Regenerate with `auth:generate` after a
# better-auth bump and commit the refreshed file.

# Build / deploy output.
.output/
.nitro/
.tanstack/
.vercel/
.vinxi/
